{"step_index":7288,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-24T15:14:36Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-24T18:14:36+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-24T18:14:36+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///D:/AI_Engineer/MSEMAX-GAIStudio/get_session.py`\nTotal Lines: 124\nTotal Bytes: 4468\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: \"\"\"\n2: MSEMAX — Google AI Studio Web Session Setup (get_session.py)\n3: \n4: This script launches a real Chromium browser via Playwright with a persistent\n5: profile (./chrome_profile). It allows the user to log into Google AI Studio\n6: (https://aistudio.google.com) once.\n7: \n8: Once logged in, the browser session, authentication state, and cookies are\n9: persisted locally in ./chrome_profile. The FastAPI server (app.py) will\n10: reuse this persistent session to automate chat completions.\n11: \n12: Usage:\n13:     python get_session.py\n14: \n15: Author: Mohamed (MSEMAX) & Antigravity\n16: License: MIT\n17: \"\"\"\n18: \n19: import os\n20: import sys\n21: import json\n22: import time\n23: import asyncio\n24: from dotenv import load_dotenv\n25: from playwright.async_api import async_playwright\n26: \n27: load_dotenv()\n28: \n29: CHROME_PROFILE_DIR = os.getenv(\"CHROME_PROFILE_DIR\", \"./chrome_profile\")\n30: TARGET_URL = \"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat\"\n31: \n32: \n33: async def main():\n34:     print(\"=\" * 65)\n35:     print(\"MSEMAX — Google AI Studio Web Hook Setup\")\n36:     print(\"=\" * 65)\n37:     print(f\"Profile directory: {CHROME_PROFILE_DIR}\")\n38:     print(f\"Target URL:        {TARGET_URL}\")\n39:     print(\"-\" * 65)\n40:     print(\"Instructions:\")\n41:     print(\"  1. A Chromium browser window will open shortly.\")\n42:     print(\"  2. Sign in to your Google Account (if prompted).\")\n43:     print(\"  3. Accept any Google AI Studio terms if it's your first time.\")\n44:     print(\"  4. Once you see the prompt chat box / 'Run' button, the script\")\n45:     print(\"     will automatically detect it and save your session!\")\n46:     print(\"-\" * 65)\n47:     print(\"Launching Chromium...\")\n48: \n49:     async with async_playwright() as p:\n50:         try:\n51:             context = await p.chromium.launch_persistent_context(\n52:                 user_data_dir=CHROME_PROFILE_DIR,\n53:                 headless=False,\n54:                 no_viewport=True,\n55:                 args=[\n56:                     \"--disable-blink-features=AutomationControlled\",\n57:                     \"--start-maximized\",\n58:                 ]\n59:             )\n60:         except Exception as e:\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
